; fhirclient -- a client of a FHIR server over HTTP/1.1: the interactions
; of the RESTful API on resources in JSON (the json package reads them), a
; search built of typed criteria, the pages of a result. What knows no
; resource type is here; the search parameters of a model's resources are
; written by the generator (codegen/client.scm) as a package of their own.
;
; NOT in it: TLS, authentication, a retry of a request that failed, more
; than one connection.

package scaly 0.1.0
package json 0.1.1

define fhirclient
{
    module Search
    module Client
}
